# Swap out the stock MC attitude/rate/allocation/position stack for the
# ported MATLAB INDI+LESO+WLS controller. rc.mc_apps (sourced by
# rc.vehicle_setup, which runs before this .post script) already started
# control_allocator, mc_rate_control, mc_att_control, flight_mode_manager
# and mc_pos_control — stop them so there is exactly one publisher of
# actuator_motors/actuator_servos and one consumer of vehicle_attitude/
# vehicle_angular_velocity. land_detector and mc_hover_thrust_estimator stay
# (harmless, useful for logging/arming logic).
control_allocator stop
mc_rate_control stop
mc_att_control stop
flight_mode_manager stop
mc_pos_control stop

mc_indi_tiltrotor start
